WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.323
The teaching database combines healthcare-style and
retail-style examples Patients

00:00:06.349 --> 00:00:12.385
gives us messy contact text Admissions gives us
timestamps for elapsed-time

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:18.189
calculations Products helps with substring and
replacement examples

00:00:20.047 --> 00:00:26.006
Orders gives us timestamps and numeric measures for
monthly summaries Staging

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:30.204
dates contains raw text dates in different formats
so we can practice safe parsing
